,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/e45051e5-9306-4d04-a7ad-b46fc8e920cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/e45051e5-9306-4d04-a7ad-b46fc8e920cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/e45051e5-9306-4d04-a7ad-b46fc8e920cf.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/a4224a3c-60cd-419d-b25f-941a5cf879f5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/a4224a3c-60cd-419d-b25f-941a5cf879f5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/a4224a3c-60cd-419d-b25f-941a5cf879f5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/a4224a3c-60cd-419d-b25f-941a5cf879f5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/a4224a3c-60cd-419d-b25f-941a5cf879f5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1736612/a4224a3c-60cd-419d-b25f-941a5cf879f5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Modern Attic Apartment with a Unique Sense of Space – approx. 85 m2 of Living Space\n\nThis exceptional attic apartment offers approximately 85 m2 of living space, providing a spacious and individual home.\n\nDue to the sloping ceilings, the apartment has a significantly larger overall floor area of around 130 m2, creating a particularly distinctive sense of space, especially in the large main living area.\n\nThe heart of the apartment is the spacious living and lounge area. It features a 75-inch TV as well as a high-quality stereo system from the German premium manufacturer T+A.\n\nA comfortable sofa with electric reclining functions invites you to relax.\n\nFor quieter moments, there is a separate reading and relaxation area with a comfortable recliner.\n\nA small balcony extends the living area and provides a convenient place to get some fresh air. It is also the designated area for guests who smoke.\n\nThe separate bedroom offers a comfortable private retreat and features an additional 55-inch TV.\n\nA staircase leads to an additional bed on the gallery level.\n\nThe kitchen is fully equipped and furnished for everyday needs.\n\nThe apartment also includes a modern washing machine and tumble dryer, located in the bathroom.\n\nThe small workspace is equipped with a widescreen monitor, keyboard, and a laser printer with scanning functionality.\n\nA particularly practical feature is the generous entrance hall, which provides additional space beyond the actual entrance area and is ideal for ample storage.\n\nAn apartment for those looking for more space, comfort and individuality, without wanting to compromise on modern and convenient amenities.\n\nYou can watch a video of the apartment at the following link:\n(hidden)","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"yes"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"yes"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"85"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":210000,"deposit":0,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"2100.00","deposit":"0.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-08-31"}],"updated":"2026-08-31T07:47:38Z","__utId__":"ut1736612"}]